SMB

A Plug-In for Mill. Put it in the "Mill Plug-Ins" folder.

  smb://host/                The server's shares
  smb://host/share/path      Server Message Block (CIFS, NT LM 0.12)

Folders are pages; files come as they are. Read-only. A guest first; if the
server refuses, Mill asks for a name and password (DOMAIN\name for a domain).

plugin://smb/about has a form, filled in from Settings.

Written from the published specifications (RFC 1001/1002, MS-CIFS, MS-NLMP,
MS-RAP, RFC 1320, FIPS 46).

Build: ./build.sh writes build/SMB.bin.
